      "slug": "spt-recoil-standalone",
      "teaser": "This mod adjusts the recoil and \"hold breath\" (sway) function whilst in ADS.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2542.png",
      "downloads": 17081,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p>.</p>\n<p># watsy’s SPT Recoil Standalone mod.</p>\n<p>I’m crap at FPS games. I need help. This little mod helps with the games recoil mechanics and it’s hold breath function whilst ADSing.</p>\n<p>Everything can be adjusted including the recoil and sway (hold breath) using the config.ts file. (open with Notepad++ for clear explanations and examples of use for the settings)</p>\n<p>The default settings I use seem really nice. You can go with those settings are play around to suit your own style. (See examples within the config).</p>\n<p>Default settings are also within the config.ts file for reference</p>\n<p>Just drop the SPT Recoil Standalone folder into the user/mods folder.</p>\n<p>Enjoy.</p>\n<p>P.S - Big Thanks to DrakiaXYZ for his help xxx</p>\n",
